OL,3,AStars from The Pitt and Abbott
OL,4,AElementary walk the red carpet at the
OL,5,APrimetime Emmy Awards
OL,6,
OL,7,FLaw & Order star Mariska Hargitay is
OL,8,Fset to host TV's biggest night, the
OL,9,F78th Primetime Emmy Awards
OL,11,FStars will soon begin arriving to walk
OL,12,Fthe red carpet at the Peacock Theater
OL,13,Fin Downtown Los Angeles - the awards
OL,14,Fshow kicks off at 17:00 local time
OL,15,F(20:00 EDT/01:00 BST)
OL,17,FLeading the pack in nominations this
OL,18,Fyear is the medical drama The Pitt,
OL,19,Fwhich is up for 25 awards - read more
OL,20,Fabout the show here
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/18
