OL,3,AMacklemore dropped from Ed Sheeran tour
OL,4,Aafter 'Free Palestine' speech
OL,5,
OL,6,FRapper Macklemore has been dropped from
OL,7,FEd Sheeran's US tour after making
OL,8,Fpro-Palestinian comments on stage
OL,9,Fearlier this month.
OL,11,FThe artist - whose real name is
OL,12,FBenjamin Haggerty - had been the
OL,13,Fopening act for Sheeran's Loop tour,
OL,14,Fbut was criticised by Jewish groups
OL,15,Fafter saying "Free Palestine" at two
OL,16,Fconcerts and making political speeches.
OL,18,FMacklemore stood by his comments on
OL,19,FMonday, confirming that he had been cut
OL,20,Ffrom the tour and writing in a
OL,21,Fstatement that the real victims are the
OL,22,FPalestinian people in Gaza.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
